A solution? I'm not sure there's even a problem.

Look, if your afraid of getting sued for using a mish mash of open
source licensed software, then you are either Google, Facebook, Apple,
Microsoft or one of the other top tier technology companies... and
you'll have a boatload of lawyers on staff to hash out the details.

Otherwise, your worries are misplaced.

Jeff

